# Paths this repository declares to the size audit, with the reason each one
# is declared. Nothing here is code somebody arranged: every entry is output
# this product wrote.

# Where the pipeline puts what it makes. `glina create`, `glina showcase` and
# the MCP tools all default to this directory, and each model arrives with the
# preview rendered beside it, so the count grows every time somebody generates
# something. A 3D model and its preview are captures, not modules: nothing
# reads them as lines, and no arrangement of sub-folders would make the
# directory mean more than "what this pipeline has produced".
assets/models
